  "usage_note": "French basketball player (Kaunase Žalgiris). In the full name only the surname takes case endings; the first name stays in the nominative. The surname is vowel-final (-o) and pronounced as spelled, so endings attach directly without an apostrophe (Franciscot, Franciscoga). The first name, if used alone, would take the vowel-joined stem Sylvaini- (omastav Sylvaini, osastav Sylvainit). Sports copy usually uses the surname alone."
